# A developer's own Worlds are local state, like data/runs: each person starts with an empty
# sandbox and builds or imports their own. The packs the tests run against are tracked separately,
# under tests/fixtures/worldpacks/, so the suite does not depend on what happens to be on a machine.
worldpacks/*
!worldpacks/.gitkeep
.scratch/**/results/
*.log
.DS_Store
.superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/
